<!-- Themed-icon (monochrome) layer: GLYPH ONLY, transparent surround.
     Launchers that theme icons (Nothing OS drawer, Pixel themed icons)
     fit-center this inside their own shape and supply the background —
     so a full-bleed square here would shrink into a "postage stamp".
     The card silhouette with the trigger square and side bars punched
     out as transparent holes scales up to fill the container instead.

     Knockout works two ways: android:fillType="evenOdd" (API 24+) AND
     counter-clockwise inner subpaths, so non-zero-winding renderers cut
     the holes too. -->
